INT. OPEN-PLAN OFFICE - "SYNERGY POD" - DAY

A grey carpet-tiled field of identical desks under a ceiling of recessed fluorescent squares. A motivational poster of a rowing team hangs crooked on a pillar. Nothing in the room is on fire, which seems to be the best that can be said for it.

BARNABY CHOWDHURY-PELL (40s, lanyard, forced cheer) stands at a whiteboard, marker raised. His direct report, ODALYS FERREIRA (30s, headphones around her neck), sits very still at the front of the room.

He caps the marker. He uncaps it. He smiles at her.

                    BARNABY
          Great news. Nobody's getting fired.

                    ODALYS
          (flat)
          Okay.

He nods. She nods. He draws a circle on the whiteboard and does not explain it.

                    BARNABY
          Instead, we're pivoting to a flat org chart.

                    ODALYS
          Meaning?

                    BARNABY
          Meaning nobody has a manager.

He caps the marker once more and sets it down with great care. She watches him do it.

                    ODALYS
          Including you.

                    BARNABY
          Especially me.

He beams. She slowly removes her headphones, lays them on the desk, and stands. He does not stop smiling as she gathers her bag and walks out. The circle on the whiteboard stays unexplained.
